 - 2026-06-16: PHASE E1 (ARC north star; accuracy) -- monotonic ARC +1 on a NEW game (total_levels >= 21). .395 advanced wa30 to L1 (20 levels); .394 walled on sc25 L6. Per ARC-AGI-3 Incremental-Progress Scoping (+1, NOT all-levels) + Failed-Experiment Rerun Discipline (a NEW game, not a re-run): target the best-headroom UNATTEMPTED game from the 25-game survey (NOT wa30, NOT sc25), with the hardened set-encoder routing the offline solver's candidate ranking. Advance ONE game by >=1 NEW real-env-confirmed level (total_levels 20 -> >=21). Report total_levels + the game advanced + levels_completed (from the solver's real-env-confirmed output, not a self-report). NO TRM training; NO leaderboard submission. An honest no-advance is COMPLETE and informs the next game pick (it is a DIFFERENT game than .395). (⚠️ Research Finding) — honest_verdict=success: incremental_progress_ls20-9607627b_advanced_to_L1_total21; results/experiment_4285_arc_incremental_progress_new_game.json
 - 2026-06-16: PHASE F1 (SOTA-ingestion; mandatory per SOTA-Ingestion Cycle Discipline) -- ingest the SOTA for the .396 bleeding-edge forks (energy/verifier-guided discrete diffusion after the full run, cross-substrate verifier generalization, verifier efficiency-parity, online/Tier-2 self-learning) and MAP the strongest 3-5 methods onto the .397 roadmap conditioned on the .396 outcomes (did the DiffusionGemma guidance moat hold? did cross-family harden on ARC-GEN? did efficiency-parity land?). Use the RELIABLE channel ONLY (scripts/sweep_clusters.py / sweep_semscholar.py + low-concurrency WebSearch/WebFetch) -- /deep-research is BANNED in-loop. Every method MUST carry a real arXiv ID/URL. Update research-studying.md (mark ingested) and emit flagged_for_v397. (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: sota_ingestion_v397_mapped; results/experiment_4286_sota_ingestion_v397.json
 - 2026-06-16: PHASE F2 (hygiene) -- reconcile the verifier registry + gaps to .396 truth, run the GAP-4 regression guard, and LOG missing-verifier gaps. Record the .396 outcomes: the DiffusionGemma guidance moat verdict (did the EXTERNAL verifier improve generation, beating RFG?), the ARC-GEN 2nd-substrate cross-family verdict, the re-powered self-learning result, the efficiency-parity result, the ARC +1 advance. Update ops/verifier_registry.yaml + ops/verifier_gaps.md (per Missing-Verifier Gap Logging: e.g. a 'learned partial-state diffusion scorer' gap if the DiffusionGemma moat arm blocked on partial states; a 'cross-substrate ARC selection' gap if ARC-GEN collapsed). Run the GAP-4 execution regression guard (no regression vs .395). Emit regression_guard_passed BARE bool. (⚠️ Research Finding) — honest_verdict=complete: registry_gaps_manifest_reconciled_to_v396_truth_regression_guard_passed_True_gaps_logged_1; results/experiment_4287_verifier_registry_gaps_hygiene.json
+- 2026-06-16: PHASE F3 (hardware continuity; opportunistic per north-star §3) -- KV260 terminal/opportunistic (SSH-only reachability + xmutil listapps; NO host SD-card precondition), PolarFire CPU dispatch hash-verify, GateMate USB detect. KV260 is terminal (north-star §3) so the per-board mandate relaxes to opportunistic; this task keeps the boards visible without blocking the milestone. Report per-board reachability + any opportunistic result. NO board blocks the milestone (honest blocked_<board> per board is fine). (⚠️ Blocked) — honest_verdict=complete: hardware_continuity_4288_kv260_kv260_terminal_xmutil_listapps_blocked_returncode_1_polarfire_polarfire_hash_verified_cpu_dispatch_succeeded_gatemate_blocked_gatemate_unreachable_ssh_usb_reachability_only; results/experiment_4288_hardware_continuity.json
